            "notes_base": "Morning in Shuhe before driving to Dali. Dongba Paper Workshop — one of 7+ branches across Lijiang, the Shuhe branch is quieter and less crowded than Old Town. Staff writes personalised Dongba script blessings inside any notebook you buy, plus stamps. Sell handmade Dongba paper notebooks (rot-resistant for centuries), bookmarks, stationery, postcards. RedNote consensus: most authentic literary souvenir in Lijiang. Open 09:00-21:00.",
            "notes_local": "下午开车去大理前的上午束河购物。束河古镇内东巴纸坊，七家分店之一，比古城店氛围更安静。消费后店员可当场用东巴象形文字写祝福语和名字，还可盖章。有东巴纸笔记本、书签、明信片，均为纳西族非遗手工纸制品。小红书多篇笔记一致推荐，情绪价值极高。",
