            "notes_base": "Xizhou morning shopping before driving to Kunming. China's first Bai ethnic tie-dye museum and national intangible cultural heritage production base. Museum FREE to enter. Paid hands-on experience: choose garment then fold, stitch, and dye with natural indigo (板蓝根). Bai elderly grandmothers guide each step. Multiple RedNote notes with 50-103 comments confirm definitive authentic experience. Zhoucheng Village is 5km north of Xizhou — perfect for Day 8 Xizhou trip. Allow 2-4 hours. Open 09:00-18:00. Family workshops nearby (eg. Dong Family Blue Dye Workshop) are cheaper alternatives.",
            "notes_local": "喜洲上午购物，之后开车去昆明。中国首家白族扎染博物馆，国家级非遗生产性示范基地。博物馆免费参观。体验区可选衣服、围巾、帆布包亲手扎染，白族嬢嬢手把手指导，用板蓝根天然靛蓝染色。周城距喜洲镇约5公里，Day 8行程完美配合。小红书高赞多篇笔记一致推荐。开放09:00-18:00，体验需2-4小时。博物馆旁有董家蓝染坊等家庭扎染坊，价格更便宜可对比。",
